    <svg width="0" height="0" style="position:absolute" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
      <symbol id="i-arrow" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 12h15M13 6l6 6-6 6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></symbol>
      <symbol id="i-down-right" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M5 5l13 13M18 8v10H8" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></symbol>
      <symbol id="i-check" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/><path d="M7.6 12.4l3 3 5.8-6.2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></symbol>
          <symbol id="i-up-right" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M6 18L18 6M8 6h10v10" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></symbol>
    </svg>

    <section class="hero hero-about hero-services hero-legal hero-case" aria-labelledby="case-title">
      <span class="hbar hbar-1" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <span class="hbar hbar-2" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <span class="hbar hbar-3" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <span class="hbar hbar-4" aria-hidden="true"></span>

      <div class="ah-copy">
        <p class="ah-label" data-reveal>Case study</p>
        <h1 id="case-title" data-speakable>
          <span class="line">Construction</span><span class="line">Website</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="ah-intro" data-reveal data-speakable>A website concept for a construction business</p>
      </div>

      <div class="svc-index cs-meta" role="group" aria-label="Project details">
        <ol>
          <li data-reveal><div class="si-row"><span class="si-n">Type</span><span class="si-t">Website Concept</span></div></li>
          <li data-reveal><div class="si-row"><span class="si-n">Industry</span><span class="si-t">Construction / Building Services</span></div></li>
          <li data-reveal><div class="si-row"><span class="si-n">Role</span><span class="si-t">Website Design &amp; Front-End Development</span></div></li>
          <li data-reveal><div class="si-row"><span class="si-n">Platform</span><span class="si-t">Systeme.io</span></div></li>
          <li data-reveal><div class="si-row"><span class="si-n">Development</span><span class="si-t">Custom HTML, CSS &amp; JavaScript</span></div></li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="ab ab-dark pj cs-open" id="overview" aria-labelledby="overview-title">
      <div class="ab-in">
        <div class="ab-split">
          <header class="ab-head">
            <p class="ab-k" data-rise>Overview</p>
            <h2 class="cs-h2" id="overview-title">Giving construction services a clearer online presence.</h2>
          </header>
          <div class="ab-body">
            <p class="ab-lead" data-rise>Choosing a construction company involves more than looking at a list of services. Potential clients need to understand what the business does, what type of projects it handles, and how to take the next step.</p><p data-rise>This website concept explores how a construction business can present its services through a structured, professional, and inquiry-focused website.</p>
            <div class="pj-actions" data-rise><a class="cta cta-menu" href="https://madfunnelservice.systeme.io/constructiondemo" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span>View Live Concept</span><span class="sr-only"> (opens in a new tab)</span><svg width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-up-right"/></svg></a></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <figure class="pj-shot cs-shot" style="--ar:16 / 9"><a class="pj-link" href="https://madfunnelservice.systeme.io/constructiondemo" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><img src="assets/img/project-empire.webp" alt="Construction website concept: the homepage headline reads Built With Precision. Managed With Accountability. Designed to Last, over a photo of sparks from a grinder." width="1280" height="720" decoding="async"><span class="pj-hint" aria-hidden="true">View live</span></a><figcaption>Homepage screenshot of the live concept</figcaption></figure>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="ab ab-white cs-sec" id="challenge" aria-labelledby="challenge-title">
      <div class="ab-in">
        <div class="ab-split">
          <header class="ab-head">
            <p class="ab-k" data-rise>The Design Challenge</p>
            <h2 class="cs-h2" id="challenge-title">Making services easier to understand before the first conversation.</h2>
          </header>
          <div class="ab-body">
            <p class="ab-lead" data-rise>Construction businesses can offer several services, from building and renovation to specialized construction work. When those services aren’t presented clearly, visitors may struggle to determine whether the company is suitable for their project.</p><p data-rise>The design direction focused on three priorities:</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <ul class="cs-points"><li data-rise><h3>Service clarity</h3><p>organize the services so visitors can quickly understand what the business offers.</p></li><li data-rise><h3>Visual credibility</h3><p>create a professional presentation that supports confidence in the business.</p></li><li data-rise><h3>Inquiry flow</h3><p>make it easier for interested visitors to find the relevant information and take the next step.</p></li></ul>
        <div class="cs-after"><p data-rise>The intention was to make the website useful as a business communication tool, not simply an online brochure.</p></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="ab ab-amber cs-sec" id="direction" aria-labelledby="direction-title">
      <span class="ab-bar ab-bar-l" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <div class="ab-in">
        <div class="ab-split">
          <header class="ab-head">
            <p class="ab-k" data-rise>The Visual Direction</p>
            <h2 class="cs-h2" id="direction-title">A structured layout built around the work.</h2>
          </header>
          <div class="ab-body">
            <p class="ab-lead" data-rise>The design uses a straightforward visual hierarchy to give the business and its services room to communicate.</p><p data-rise>Rather than placing every service into an identical block, the layout uses typography, spacing, imagery, and section composition to create a more deliberate browsing experience.</p><p data-rise>The main design considerations included:</p>
            <ul class="cs-list" data-rise><li><svg width="22" height="22" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-check"/></svg><span>A clear opening message that introduces the business.</span></li><li><svg width="22" height="22" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-check"/></svg><span>Service sections that make the company’s offerings easier to scan.</span></li><li><svg width="22" height="22" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-check"/></svg><span>Visual areas that support the presentation of construction work.</span></li><li><svg width="22" height="22" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-check"/></svg><span>Consistent typography and spacing throughout the page.</span></li><li><svg width="22" height="22" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-check"/></svg><span>Clear calls to action that give visitors a next step.</span></li></ul>
            <p data-rise>The visual approach keeps the business at the center of the experience.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="ab ab-dark cs-sec" id="development" aria-labelledby="development-title">
      <div class="ab-in">
        <div class="ab-split">
          <header class="ab-head">
            <p class="ab-k" data-rise>The Development</p>
            <h2 class="cs-h2" id="development-title">Turning the design into a responsive website.</h2>
          </header>
          <div class="ab-body">
            <p class="ab-lead" data-rise>The concept was built on Systeme.io, with custom front-end code used to extend the platform’s standard page-building capabilities.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <ul class="dm-rows cs-tools"><li><h3 data-rise>Systeme.io</h3><div data-rise><p>Used as the website platform and publishing environment.</p></div></li><li><h3 data-rise>Custom HTML &amp; CSS</h3><div data-rise><p>Used to control the layout, visual styling, and responsive presentation.</p></div></li><li><h3 data-rise>JavaScript</h3><div data-rise><p>Used for custom interface behavior and interactions where needed.</p></div></li></ul>
        <div class="cs-after"><p data-rise>The result is a website concept that combines a managed publishing platform with a more tailored front-end presentation.</p></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="ab ab-white cs-sec" id="build" aria-labelledby="build-title">
      <div class="ab-in">
        <div class="ab-split">
          <header class="ab-head">
            <p class="ab-k" data-rise>What Went Into the Build</p>
            <h2 class="cs-h2" id="build-title">Design decisions translated into a working website concept.</h2>
          </header>
        </div>
        <div class="cs-table" data-rise><table><caption class="sr-only">Construction Website: what went into the build</caption><thead><tr><th scope="col">Area</th><th scope="col">Implementation</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Website direction</th><td>Construction-focused visual presentation</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Content structure</th><td>Organized service information</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">User experience</th><td>Clear information hierarchy and navigation</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Front-end</th><td>Custom HTML, CSS and JavaScript</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Platform</th><td>Systeme.io</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Responsive design</th><td>Layout adjustments for desktop and mobile</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="ab ab-dark cs-sec" id="result" aria-labelledby="result-title">
      <div class="ab-in">
        <div class="ab-split">
          <header class="ab-head">
            <p class="ab-k" data-rise>The Result</p>
            <h2 class="cs-h2" id="result-title">A clearer way to present construction services online.</h2>
          </header>
          <div class="ab-body">
            <p class="ab-lead" data-rise>The construction website concept demonstrates how service information, visual presentation, and inquiry pathways can work together in a single website.</p><p data-rise>It reflects my approach to building service-business websites: make the offer easier to understand, establish a professional first impression, and give visitors a clear way to get in touch.</p>
            <p class="cs-note" data-rise><em>This is an independent website concept, not a commissioned client project. It does not represent verified business results or performance data.</em></p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <nav class="cs-next" aria-label="More case studies" data-rise>
          <a href="/projects#construction-website"><span class="cs-next-k">All projects</span><span class="cs-next-t">Back to the project overview</span></a>
          <a href="/case-interior-design-website"><span class="cs-next-k">Next case study</span><span class="cs-next-t">Interior Design Website</span><svg width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-arrow"/></svg></a>
        </nav>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="ab ab-amber ab-cta" id="lets-talk" aria-labelledby="talk-title">
      <span class="ab-bar ab-bar-l" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <span class="ab-bar ab-bar-r" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <div class="ab-in">
        <h2 class="cs-cta-h" id="talk-title">Does Your Website Explain Your Services Clearly?</h2>
        <div class="ab-cta-body">
          <p class="ab-lead" data-rise>If potential customers visit your website but struggle to understand what you offer or how to contact you, the structure may need another look.</p>
          <p data-rise>I design and develop websites that make business information easier to navigate and act on.</p>
          <div class="ab-cta-actions" data-rise>
            <a class="cta cta-solid" href="https://calendly.com/-aldrichmatthew/15mins"><span>Book a Free Strategy Call</span><svg width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-arrow"/></svg></a>
            <a class="cta cta-ghost" href="/projects"><span>Explore More Projects</span><svg width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-arrow"/></svg></a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

  
</Base>
